This project adapts the Apache-2.0 licensed Laya encoder implementation and
initializes its encoder from convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual. The original
typed-decision heads and their calibration parameters are not retained.

Laya — Convai Innovations / NandhaKishorM and contributors
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual

Laya MLX — mizorewww and contributors
https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx

Laya Core ML — mizorewww and contributors
https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-coreml

The multilingual encoder architecture is mmBERT / ModernBERT. The initialization
revision, model file checksums, tokenizer provenance, and adapted implementation
sources are recorded in provenance/initialization.json. Third-party trademarks
remain the property of their respective owners. No endorsement is implied.
